Modifications by XECKernelPro (GPL-3.0 section 5(a) notice):
----------------------------------------------------------
This tree is NOT a pristine upstream snapshot. XECKernelPro modifies the
following Java sources in place; the complete corresponding source of each
modified file is this repository, and each file keeps its upstream license
header. Upstream remains Enginex0/TEESimulator-RS.

  * app/src/main/java/org/matrix/TEESimulator/attestation/AttestationPatcher.kt
      - rewrite the software-enforced RootOfTrust copy as well as the
        TEE-enforced one.
  * app/src/main/java/org/matrix/TEESimulator/interception/keystore/InterceptorUtils.kt
      - keep the patched key characteristics (tag 704) consistent with the
        certificate copy.
  * app/src/main/java/org/matrix/TEESimulator/interception/keystore/shim/KeyMintSecurityLevelInterceptor.kt
      - cache invalidation helpers (forgetCachedChain, findKeyIdentifierByNspace,
        cleanupKeyData on import).
  * app/src/main/java/org/matrix/TEESimulator/interception/keystore/Keystore2Interceptor.kt
      - grant ledger so a Domain.GRANT read resolves to the owner's chain,
        key-descriptor re-serialisation for the native reply shape, and (2026-10-11)
        a getKeyEntry post-hook gate on shouldSkipUid() plus a cache guard that
        refuses to cache a chain whose leaf was not actually rewritten.

